                        "entry_id": "939b6a10-e678-311a-bb9a-8665cddb2b37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In the middle of a ship, either longitudinally or laterally."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f7740d2-1504-4978-80dd-b49b396a1936",
                                "sense_id": "b14c34d5-20bb-3a36-84ac-8c519605e2a7",
                                "text": "[The U-boat captain] waited until the crosshairs lay directly amidships."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e8cca9c-da9e-423e-910d-6d42c21ff12a",
                                "sense_id": "b14c34d5-20bb-3a36-84ac-8c519605e2a7",
                                "text": "Two more torpedoes were fired; one ran erratic; the second hit amidships."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a022abce-b019-4b01-9d3b-b21d3ff2bb37",
                                "sense_id": "b14c34d5-20bb-3a36-84ac-8c519605e2a7",
                                "text": "The saloon, instead of being at the stern, according to the old method of construction, is placed more amidships."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf23f6f6-6d8a-41b9-bfe2-7aac2cb185c0",
                                "sense_id": "b14c34d5-20bb-3a36-84ac-8c519605e2a7",
                                "text": "The main cabin, most amidships, was 8 feet 3 inches broad …"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b02f95b7-9458-3be6-b103-8ccb0218ff74",
                        "entry_id": "939b6a10-e678-311a-bb9a-8665cddb2b37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Usually in the line of the keel, but sometimes halfway between bow and stern; often contracted to “midships.” (FM 55-501)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9beda70b-6ab5-3c2b-a29b-8ce3df4cc066",
                        "entry_id": "939b6a10-e678-311a-bb9a-8665cddb2b37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "On the flank, at a vulnerable place."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively",
                            "not-comparable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2391ba1-371d-42cc-a3e3-82a1b7212f4d",
                                "sense_id": "9beda70b-6ab5-3c2b-a29b-8ce3df4cc066",
                                "text": "In stating that the Woosters never give up, I was in error. These words caught me amidships and took all the fighting spirit out of me, leaving me a spent force."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
